Package: glyph
Title: A Grammar of Interactive Graphics
Version: 0.1.1.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Joash Joshua", "Ayo", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "joashjoshua789@gmail.com"),
    person("Mike", "Bostock", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
    comment = "Author of the bundled D3.js library"))
Description: Builds interactive graphics from a declarative specification.
    Marks, scales, tooltips, hover and click events, zoom, brushing, linked
    selections, animated transitions and multi-plot layouts are declared in
    one pipeline and stored as a plain R list that can be inspected, saved as
    'JSON' or converted to 'Vega-Lite'. Themes are set from a small set of
    design tokens. Plots are drawn in the browser as 'htmlwidgets' using
    'D3.js'.
